abstract: >
  Lux Ferox operationalises Total Surprise (S_total) as the Kullback-Leibler divergence
  between a generative model and empirical observations, bounded below by Landauer's
  erasure cost: W_min = k_B T ln2 · S_total. Architecture spans 5 layers from
  holographic quantum gravity (L0) to live intelligence instances (L4).
  Synthetic peer-review methodology: human epistemic direction + adversarial multi-LLM
  collaboration. Explicit epistemic labelling: MEASURED / ESTIMATED / STRUCTURAL / SPECULATIVE.
